nched wetlands, and forgotten dungeons full of danger. Meet countless interesting characters with unique dialog and quests, and leave your mark on this mysterious world.","steam_appid":1154960,"support_info":{"email":"support@ardenfall.com","url":"https://ardenfall.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://ardenfall.com"}